Mozilla Readability
-------------------

src/read/html/readability.ts adapts the core article-scoring algorithm from
Mozilla Readability to pluma's own HTML tree. Its scoring formulas, tag weights,
and several regular expressions derive from Readability.js; this is not a
line-for-line port of the full library.

